WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:37.840
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
01:38.110 --> 01:43.970
[Small Town Remedy]

3
01:44.240 --> 01:46.789
[Episode 6]

4
02:00.040 --> 02:00.430
Chen.

5
02:00.430 --> 02:01.710
Does your brother have a girlfriend?

6
02:01.710 --> 02:02.430
My brother?

7
02:02.430 --> 02:03.310
I don't think so. Why?

8
02:03.310 --> 02:03.920
Perfect!

9
02:04.280 --> 02:05.480
I've got my eye on him.

10
02:06.380 --> 02:09.289
[Non-Smoking Ward]

11
02:10.870 --> 02:11.560
Where is he?

12
02:12.630 --> 02:13.310
Right here.

13
02:16.190 --> 02:17.030
So, you heard

14
02:17.030 --> 02:18.230
what I just said, huh?

15
02:19.280 --> 02:20.560
What do you think?

16
02:20.560 --> 02:22.000
Give me a straight answer.

17
02:22.000 --> 02:23.680
Chen, are you serious?

18
02:23.710 --> 02:24.870
Why wouldn't I be?

19
02:25.030 --> 02:25.710
W-What

20
02:25.870 --> 02:27.240
do you see in him?

21
02:31.280 --> 02:33.140
I think you're good enough for me.

22
02:36.030 --> 02:37.079
Why don't we give it a shot?

23
02:37.079 --> 02:37.940
What do you say?

24
02:41.120 --> 02:43.120
I don't think you're good enough for me.

25
02:43.120 --> 02:44.050
What did you say?

26
02:44.400 --> 02:45.400
You heard me.

27
02:46.120 --> 02:46.980
Say that again.

28
02:52.400 --> 02:53.280
I said

29
02:53.710 --> 02:54.800
we're not right for each other.

30
02:54.800 --> 02:56.400
No, that's not what you said.

31
02:57.000 --> 02:58.150
You said

32
02:58.870 --> 03:00.470
I wasn't good enough for you.

33
03:00.870 --> 03:01.590
I'm off to work.

34
03:01.590 --> 03:02.560
Get back here!

35
03:06.470 --> 03:08.710
You think I'm being nice to you, so you can walk all over me?

36
03:08.710 --> 03:10.240
I give you a couple of compliments, and suddenly

37
03:10.240 --> 03:11.680
you're all high and mighty?

38
03:11.680 --> 03:13.680
You think you can get away with this?

39
03:14.560 --> 03:16.000
Getting all cocky, huh?

40
03:18.079 --> 03:19.560
You think I can't find a man?

41
03:19.560 --> 03:21.960
It's not like I'm begging you for anything!

42
03:22.590 --> 03:23.430
What,

43
03:24.079 --> 03:25.150
do you have eight kidneys or something?

44
03:25.150 --> 03:27.120
Why should I have to chase after you, huh?

45
03:27.120 --> 03:27.910
Huh, man?

46
03:28.910 --> 03:29.960
Listen,

47
03:30.430 --> 03:31.280
I'm not even gonna

48
03:31.280 --> 03:32.540
bother with you today.

49
03:34.710 --> 03:35.770
I'm giving you time

50
03:36.520 --> 03:38.050
to go ask around and find out

51
03:38.280 --> 03:39.960
what people around this area think of me.

52
03:39.960 --> 03:40.750
Got it?

53
03:45.000 --> 03:45.860
You barbarian.

54
03:46.200 --> 03:50.740
[Vending Machine]

55
03:47.079 --> 03:48.340
You've got some nerve!

56
03:57.430 --> 03:58.960
Am I not good enough for him?

57
03:59.310 --> 04:00.470
He's not good enough for you.

58
04:00.470 --> 04:00.960
He is.

59
04:02.470 --> 04:03.150
Get over here.

60
04:03.150 --> 04:04.080
D-Don't hit me!

61
04:04.080 --> 04:05.190
If you do, I'll just lie down on the ground!

62
04:05.190 --> 04:06.430
Get over here!

63
04:07.470 --> 04:08.270
Get over here!

64
04:24.800 --> 04:25.270
Let's get started.

65
04:25.270 --> 04:25.720
Okay.

66
04:31.040 --> 04:32.190
Perform a lumbar puncture to measure the opening pressure

67
04:32.190 --> 04:34.750
and collect cerebrospinal fluid for analysis.

68
04:34.750 --> 04:35.390
Doctor,

69
04:36.159 --> 04:37.890
what's wrong with my daughter?

70
04:40.120 --> 04:41.680
She was fine when we left.

71
04:42.000 --> 04:43.190
The patient has a high fever

72
04:43.190 --> 04:44.390
and nuchal rigidity.

73
04:45.159 --> 04:46.760
An intracranial infection?

74
04:47.360 --> 04:49.159
Let's wait for the test results.

75
04:49.310 --> 04:49.920
Doctor,

76
04:50.600 --> 04:51.800
money's not an issue.

77
04:52.070 --> 04:53.950
Give my daughter the best medication.

78
04:53.950 --> 04:55.480
Don't worry about the money just yet.

79
04:55.480 --> 04:56.480
If an intracranial infection

80
04:56.480 --> 04:57.510
is confirmed,

81
04:57.630 --> 04:58.480
she'll need

82
04:58.480 --> 05:01.010
antibiotics classified as restricted-use.

83
05:05.040 --> 05:06.430
We're out of money.

84
05:06.430 --> 05:07.360
Will you shut up?

85
05:08.510 --> 05:10.510
I'll go borrow some money right now.

86
05:12.630 --> 05:14.920
They might not be able to borrow any money.

87
05:14.920 --> 05:16.270
There's no time to worry about money.

88
05:16.040 --> 05:19.080
[Nurses' Station]

89
05:16.360 --> 05:17.760
We need to save her first.

90
05:23.600 --> 05:24.330
You go first.

91
05:25.190 --> 05:25.800
Hello.

92
05:25.950 --> 05:26.510
Hello.

93
05:26.510 --> 05:27.510
Is Dr. Yang Ran here?

94
05:27.510 --> 05:28.430
He's next door.

95
05:28.430 --> 05:28.950
Thank you.

96
05:28.950 --> 05:29.880
You're welcome.

97
05:35.120 --> 05:36.450
Working that hard, huh?

98
05:37.240 --> 05:38.100
Director Chen,

99
05:38.310 --> 05:39.070
what brings you here?

100
05:39.070 --> 05:40.270
Just came to see you.

101
05:42.190 --> 05:43.159
I heard your hospital

102
05:43.159 --> 05:44.430
has a new doctor,

103
05:44.600 --> 05:45.530
Liu Zhengliang,

104
05:45.950 --> 05:47.680
who performed a major surgery.

105
05:47.830 --> 05:49.560
Let me see the medical records.

106
05:50.830 --> 05:51.630
That won't do.

107
05:51.630 --> 05:52.870
I'm afraid that wouldn't be appropriate.

108
05:52.870 --> 05:54.120
Why not?

109
05:54.510 --> 05:55.750
We're sister hospitals,

110
05:55.750 --> 05:56.750
and I'm an expert.

111
05:58.360 --> 05:59.480
The hospital has its rules.

112
05:59.480 --> 06:01.280
Can't I learn something from it?

113
06:02.560 --> 06:03.480
Forget it, forget it.

114
06:03.480 --> 06:04.070
Pretend I never asked.

115
06:04.070 --> 06:04.390
Director Chen.

116
06:04.390 --> 06:05.720
What are you doing here?

117
06:06.160 --> 06:06.870
Easy, easy.

118
06:06.870 --> 06:07.870
I'll take you there, all right?

119
06:07.870 --> 06:08.400
Let's go.

120
06:09.870 --> 06:11.800
Doctor, could you hurry things up?

121
06:12.270 --> 06:13.930
Any chance I could cut in line?

122
06:14.630 --> 06:15.920
No need. You're the only one here.

123
06:15.920 --> 06:16.800
What line?

124
06:17.920 --> 06:18.950
Sign here.

125
06:19.300 --> 06:22.600
[Body Fluid Specimen Drop-Off]

126
06:23.870 --> 06:24.480
Just wait.

127
06:43.510 --> 06:44.720
If it were me,

128
06:45.000 --> 06:47.130
I wouldn't dare pull a stunt like that.

129
06:48.830 --> 06:50.000
What a genius.

130
07:00.270 --> 07:03.630
What gives him the right to turn my daughter down?

131
07:05.750 --> 07:07.920
Look at her! She's got tons

132
07:08.160 --> 07:09.950
o-of guys chasing

133
07:10.720 --> 07:12.190
after her around here.

134
07:12.800 --> 07:14.330
Why not give it another try?

135
07:15.510 --> 07:17.510
It's not easy to find someone you really like.

136
07:17.510 --> 07:18.710
I'm not trying again.

137
07:19.120 --> 07:20.510
I won't settle for someone I like

138
07:20.510 --> 07:21.840
or someone who likes me.

139
07:22.390 --> 07:25.190
It has to be someone I love and who loves me back.

140
07:25.920 --> 07:26.650
No settling.

141
07:29.870 --> 07:30.680
I've gotten all my friends

142
07:30.680 --> 07:31.870
from the winter fishing community

143
07:31.870 --> 07:32.800
to help search.

144
07:33.270 --> 07:34.390
Still nothing.

145
07:34.390 --> 07:35.070
We still haven't

146
07:35.070 --> 07:36.070
found your mom.

147
07:37.680 --> 07:38.390
It's okay.

148
07:39.560 --> 07:40.420
You were right.

149
07:42.190 --> 07:43.510
No news is good news.

150
07:44.480 --> 07:46.810
As long as there's hope, that's good news.

151
08:08.110 --> 08:09.770
Her temperature's come down.

152
08:11.720 --> 08:12.800
Run the tests again

153
08:13.310 --> 08:15.440
and check the protein and cell counts.

154
08:16.480 --> 08:17.190
Um, Doctor...

155
08:17.190 --> 08:17.800
A cotton swab.

156
08:17.800 --> 08:19.360
I-I mean, please give our Jiao

157
08:19.360 --> 08:20.890
whatever the best medicine

158
08:21.070 --> 08:22.950
you have here is.

159
08:23.920 --> 08:24.980
Money's no object.

160
08:25.630 --> 08:26.510
You don't need to keep talking to me

161
08:26.510 --> 08:27.360
about money.

162
08:27.800 --> 08:28.800
I'm a doctor.

163
08:28.800 --> 08:30.070
My job is to treat patients.

164
08:30.070 --> 08:31.800
Money has nothing to do with it.

165
08:32.320 --> 08:33.480
I'm sorry, Doctor.

166
08:33.960 --> 08:35.559
I didn't mean anything by it.

167
08:49.000 --> 08:51.200
Zhang Jiao's white blood cell count has come down.

168
08:51.200 --> 08:52.750
Other than the antibiotics,

169
08:52.750 --> 08:53.200
there really isn't much else

170
08:53.200 --> 08:54.530
that'll cost them a lot.

171
08:55.270 --> 08:56.670
We're still short by 153.

172
08:56.840 --> 08:58.320
We're short by 153, right?

173
08:58.760 --> 09:02.260
[Work-Related Injury Registration and Billing]

174
08:59.120 --> 08:59.910
Look,

175
09:00.320 --> 09:01.960
I've got 86 on this card,

176
09:02.480 --> 09:04.120
and another 60-something.

177
09:04.120 --> 09:05.440
I'll get you the rest tomorrow.

178
09:05.440 --> 09:06.790
I'll go see what I can do right now,

179
09:06.790 --> 09:07.480
okay?

180
09:10.270 --> 09:11.480
I'll definitely have it by tomorrow.

181
09:11.480 --> 09:13.140
We can't stop the medication.

182
10:13.150 --> 10:15.280
Why didn't you knock before coming in?

183
10:15.480 --> 10:16.440
I did.

184
10:18.720 --> 10:19.650
What do you need?

185
10:20.510 --> 10:21.840
Can we waive part

186
10:21.840 --> 10:23.570
of Zhang Jiao's medical bills?

187
10:28.030 --> 10:28.630
No.

188
10:29.910 --> 10:31.000
Does Xiaoximen Hospital

189
10:31.000 --> 10:31.960
have any

190
10:31.960 --> 10:33.390
charitable assistance programs?

191
10:33.390 --> 10:34.550
Given our hospital's reputation,

192
10:34.550 --> 10:35.550
what do you think?

193
10:39.320 --> 10:40.320
Here's the thing.

194
10:40.630 --> 10:41.630
Zhang Jiao's case

195
10:41.630 --> 10:42.910
is highly representative.

196
10:42.910 --> 10:44.120
If we can save her,

197
10:44.270 --> 10:45.440
I can't speak for the whole country,

198
10:45.440 --> 10:47.720
but it would certainly be a rare case in the province.

199
10:47.720 --> 10:48.790
It's worth publicizing

200
10:48.790 --> 10:51.190
and could help turn our reputation around.

201
10:51.750 --> 10:53.000
With that in mind,

202
10:53.480 --> 10:55.210
is there room for negotiation?

203
11:03.670 --> 11:05.600
I don't care what your reasons are.

204
11:05.960 --> 11:07.390
As long as you stay,

205
11:07.630 --> 11:08.360
we can talk.

206
11:09.600 --> 11:11.320
Those antibiotics are expensive.

207
11:11.320 --> 11:12.200
If you leave

208
11:12.870 --> 11:14.960
and something unexpected happens to her,

209
11:14.960 --> 11:16.510
all that money I've spent will have gone to waste.

210
11:16.510 --> 11:18.000
You're a hospital president.

211
11:18.000 --> 11:19.390
How can you think about nothing but money?

212
11:19.390 --> 11:20.720
You're a doctor,

213
11:21.360 --> 11:22.270
yet you're here talking to me

214
11:22.270 --> 11:23.360
about money, too.

215
11:42.150 --> 11:43.010
How about this?

216
11:43.320 --> 11:44.200
I'll waive 40%

217
11:44.200 --> 11:46.960
of her medical expenses,

218
11:47.720 --> 11:49.120
but you'll owe me a favor.

219
11:52.790 --> 11:53.390
Deal.

220
11:53.390 --> 11:55.120
But let me make one thing clear:

221
11:55.320 --> 11:56.480
I'll leave as soon as she wakes up.

222
11:56.480 --> 11:57.870
Pleasure doing this with you.

223
11:57.870 --> 11:58.440
Wait,

224
12:01.440 --> 12:02.900
let me show you something.

225
12:05.150 --> 12:05.680
Let's go.

226
12:10.800 --> 12:11.470
[Laboratory Department] [Restroom]

227
12:11.470 --> 12:11.690
[Xiaoximen Hospital]

228
12:11.760 --> 12:14.400
[Biochemistry Laboratory] [Laboratory]

229
12:12.120 --> 12:13.050
President Long.

230
12:14.470 --> 12:15.510
[Immunology Laboratory]

231
12:21.870 --> 12:22.550
This way.

232
12:39.750 --> 12:41.410
Does this room look familiar?

233
12:45.600 --> 12:46.510
It's yours now.

234
12:46.720 --> 12:47.720
If you live here instead of commuting,

235
12:47.720 --> 12:49.200
you won't be affected by the snow,

236
12:49.200 --> 12:50.270
whenever it falls.

237
13:42.870 --> 13:44.440
No need to thank me.

238
13:44.630 --> 13:46.440
I'm doing it to exploit you.

239
13:58.030 --> 13:58.600
You didn't

240
13:58.600 --> 14:00.200
plan this all along, did you?

241
14:03.390 --> 14:06.250
How could I have planned for that patient to show up?

242
14:08.440 --> 14:09.080
Well,

243
14:09.080 --> 14:10.120
the president said

244
14:10.120 --> 14:10.670
he could waive

245
14:10.670 --> 14:12.270
40% of the medical expenses.

246
14:12.840 --> 14:13.750
For Zhang Jiao?

247
14:15.000 --> 14:16.630
Did you went to see the president?

248
14:16.630 --> 14:18.160
How did you get him to agree?

249
14:18.670 --> 14:20.000
You can go

250
14:20.000 --> 14:21.730
tell the patient's family now.

251
14:22.510 --> 14:24.080
Go on, take the credit.

252
14:24.080 --> 14:26.940
If I tell them, they'll feel like they owe me a favor.

253
14:27.720 --> 14:28.550
I don't mind.

254
14:32.270 --> 14:32.870
So,

255
14:33.120 --> 14:34.870
um... are you still leaving?

256
14:42.510 --> 14:43.720
Not for now.

257
14:45.150 --> 14:46.720
Then go tell them. Go on.

258
14:48.080 --> 14:49.670
He told you to go, so just go.

259
14:49.670 --> 14:51.480
Why are you acting all shy?

260
14:51.870 --> 14:53.400
What's it got to do with you?

261
14:56.750 --> 14:57.360
What,

262
14:58.320 --> 14:59.440
are we off work already?

263
14:59.440 --> 15:00.120
No.

264
15:01.360 --> 15:03.120
Well, Dr. Liu said

265
15:03.120 --> 15:04.320
he's not leaving for now.

266
15:04.320 --> 15:05.240
He just talked to the president

267
15:05.240 --> 15:07.200
and got Zhang Jiao's medical expenses

268
15:07.200 --> 15:08.480
reduced by 40%.

269
15:09.270 --> 15:09.960
Really?

270
15:10.630 --> 15:12.230
That's great! That's great!

271
15:14.670 --> 15:15.360
All right, all right.

272
15:15.360 --> 15:16.480
Dinner's on me tonight!

273
15:16.480 --> 15:17.610
Let's get together!

274
15:18.080 --> 15:19.600
Seriously, Huang?

275
15:19.670 --> 15:21.150
I-I'm calling to confirm it.

276
15:21.150 --> 15:22.030
You're so generous!

277
15:22.030 --> 15:22.550
Let's celebrate

278
15:22.550 --> 15:23.630
Dr. Liu's

279
15:23.630 --> 15:25.270
return!

280
15:25.790 --> 15:26.600
Li,

281
15:26.600 --> 15:26.910
Li,

282
15:26.910 --> 15:27.910
eserve that big private room

283
15:27.910 --> 15:28.600
for me tonight.

284
15:28.600 --> 15:30.320
I don't like social gatherings.

285
15:30.320 --> 15:31.270
I'm socially awkward.

286
15:31.270 --> 15:32.200
I'll pass.

287
15:32.670 --> 15:33.510
Wait a second.

288
15:35.240 --> 15:36.080
Come on, Dr. Liu.

289
15:36.080 --> 15:37.000
Let's go.

290
15:37.240 --> 15:38.910
Our team hasn't had a dinner together yet.

291
15:38.910 --> 15:40.080
It'll be a great chance for everyone

292
15:40.080 --> 15:40.840
to get to know each other.

293
15:40.840 --> 15:42.120
Exactly!

294
15:42.120 --> 15:44.480
-Let's all get together and have some fun. -I'm here to work,

295
15:44.480 --> 15:46.080
not to build relationships.

296
15:52.150 --> 15:52.750
L-Li,

297
15:52.750 --> 15:54.000
I'll call you back.

298
15:54.000 --> 15:55.510
Okay, okay.

299
15:56.600 --> 15:57.670
We're just happy

300
15:57.670 --> 15:58.800
for you, that's all.

301
15:59.510 --> 16:00.390
Fine, fine, fine.

302
16:00.390 --> 16:00.910
No worries,

303
16:00.910 --> 16:01.960
no pressure.

304
16:13.510 --> 16:15.110
The president, honestly...

305
16:15.790 --> 16:17.080
What's wrong, Huang?

306
16:17.320 --> 16:19.270
Nothing. It's just that our president

307
16:19.270 --> 16:21.320
keeps using this trick, and it works every time.

308
16:21.320 --> 16:22.320
What trick?

309
16:22.630 --> 16:24.000
Isn't it the same thing

310
16:24.030 --> 16:25.480
he did with Dr. Liu?

311
16:25.550 --> 16:27.150
The same old trick. You know.

312
16:27.200 --> 16:28.910
Remember last time, Mingming?

313
16:28.910 --> 16:30.030
Didn't you make him waive

314
16:30.030 --> 16:31.240
the medical expenses

315
16:31.240 --> 16:32.200
for that patient, too?

316
16:32.200 --> 16:33.080
What was

317
16:33.240 --> 16:34.500
that condition again?

318
16:37.600 --> 16:39.270
The... the...

319
16:40.030 --> 16:41.790
spontaneous brain... brain hemorrhage case,

320
16:41.790 --> 16:42.270
right?

321
16:42.600 --> 16:43.630
I remember that one.

322
16:43.630 --> 16:45.240
She got played by the president.

323
16:45.240 --> 16:46.000
Dr. Che,

324
16:47.240 --> 16:49.300
how did the president screw you over?

325
16:54.080 --> 16:54.600
Hold on.

326
16:56.320 --> 16:57.960
We shouldn't talk about the president here.

327
16:57.960 --> 16:58.550
It's not good.

328
16:58.550 --> 16:59.960
It's not the right place.

329
17:00.240 --> 17:01.240
Honestly,

330
17:01.240 --> 17:02.550
when you're new here,

331
17:03.120 --> 17:04.200
you really should join us

332
17:04.200 --> 17:05.000
for more get-togethers.

333
17:05.000 --> 17:05.440
Right.

334
17:05.440 --> 17:06.880
You need to get to know Xiaoximen Hospital better.

335
17:06.880 --> 17:07.310
Right.

336
17:07.310 --> 17:08.640
Most importantly, you need to understand

337
17:08.640 --> 17:09.960
what kind of person our president really is.

338
17:09.960 --> 17:11.359
So how did things work out

339
17:11.440 --> 17:13.099
between you and him in the end?

340
17:15.829 --> 17:16.790
No, not here.

341
17:16.790 --> 17:17.589
Not here.

342
17:17.589 --> 17:18.310
Let's talk about it at the restaurant.

343
17:18.310 --> 17:19.109
Let's talk about it at the restaurant.

344
17:19.109 --> 17:19.550
Come on, come on,

345
17:19.550 --> 17:21.920
-Let's talk about it at the restaurant. -Let's go.

346
17:21.920 --> 17:23.030
Why go so early?

347
17:23.349 --> 17:24.640
We'll be there for the first seating,

348
17:24.640 --> 17:25.750
so the food will come out faster.

349
17:25.750 --> 17:26.510
Huang,

350
17:26.510 --> 17:28.240
you've thought of everything.

351
17:29.480 --> 17:29.830
Come on,

352
17:29.830 --> 17:30.890
let's go! Let's go!

353
17:48.480 --> 17:49.200
Kang Sheng?

354
17:49.590 --> 17:50.110
Yeah.

355
17:52.200 --> 17:52.730
Yang Ran.

356
17:54.030 --> 17:54.480
Huang.

357
17:54.480 --> 17:56.340
Let's get together another time.

358
17:57.920 --> 17:58.640
Well...

359
17:59.350 --> 18:01.410
How long has your vision been blurry?

360
18:02.680 --> 18:03.960
About half a year.

361
18:04.440 --> 18:06.350
Everything looks blurry,

362
18:06.550 --> 18:08.810
like I'm looking through frosted glass.

363
18:10.550 --> 18:11.950
Let me check your pupils.

364
18:12.030 --> 18:14.480
Doctor, there's no need. Don't bother.

365
18:15.000 --> 18:16.880
I had an MRI at No. 1 Hospital.

366
18:17.550 --> 18:19.480
They said I have a pituitary tumor.

367
18:20.000 --> 18:22.310
The doctor said

368
18:22.720 --> 18:25.270
it's best to have a family member with me when I have brain surgery.

369
18:25.270 --> 18:26.270
The thing is,

370
18:27.310 --> 18:28.370
I can't find anyone

371
18:28.640 --> 18:29.500
to come with me.

372
18:31.350 --> 18:33.400
Doctor, please, help me out.

373
18:34.200 --> 18:35.070
No, you...

374
18:35.200 --> 18:37.400
You can't do this. Take your money back.

375
18:37.440 --> 18:38.640
Let me do this. Let me.

376
18:39.480 --> 18:41.000
Zhong Yang. Zhong Yang!

377
18:41.750 --> 18:42.480
Buddy!

378
18:43.830 --> 18:44.550
Huang.

379
18:44.550 --> 18:45.110
Man,

380
18:45.110 --> 18:46.110
it's been ages since we all got together.

381
18:46.110 --> 18:46.790
I've missed you, you know?

382
18:46.790 --> 18:47.830
Yeah, yeah, I know, Huang.

383
18:47.830 --> 18:48.640
I'm starving.

384
18:49.960 --> 18:51.510
You guys go ahead. I'm not coming.

385
18:51.510 --> 18:52.510
Come on, Dr. Liu.

386
18:52.510 --> 18:54.440
It's fine. They're colleagues from other departments.

387
18:54.440 --> 18:55.200
Let me introduce you to everyone.

388
18:55.200 --> 18:55.480
Everyone,

389
18:55.480 --> 18:56.680
let me introduce

390
18:56.680 --> 18:58.480
our department's new colleague,

391
18:58.480 --> 18:59.410
Liu Zhengliang.

392
18:59.510 --> 19:00.750
He's, uh...

393
19:00.960 --> 19:01.720
he just got here.

394
19:01.720 --> 19:03.350
He's a little shy,

395
19:03.480 --> 19:04.750
but this young man

396
19:04.750 --> 19:05.790
is really good at his job.

397
19:05.790 --> 19:07.590
People who are good at their jobs

398
19:07.590 --> 19:08.790
tend to be a little...

399
19:08.880 --> 19:09.400
Yeah.

400
19:09.400 --> 19:09.920
It's okay, buddy.

401
19:09.920 --> 19:11.000
I know you don't know anyone yet.

402
19:11.000 --> 19:11.350
Come on

403
19:11.350 --> 19:12.400
and have dinner with us,

404
19:12.400 --> 19:13.310
and you'll get to know everyone.

405
19:13.310 --> 19:13.830
-Let's go. -Let's go.

406
19:13.830 --> 19:14.550
-Let's go. -Let's go.

407
19:14.550 --> 19:15.610
Let's go together.

408
19:15.720 --> 19:16.440
Let's go.

409
19:16.830 --> 19:17.640
I'm thinking

410
19:17.920 --> 19:20.030
of installing a row of cabinets here,

411
19:20.200 --> 19:21.000
um...

412
19:21.030 --> 19:22.720
selling fresh flowers here,

413
19:23.000 --> 19:24.730
putting funeral wreaths here,

414
19:25.070 --> 19:27.440
and stocking burial clothes and funeral caskets here.

415
19:27.440 --> 19:28.720
Then I'll put a sofa here

416
19:28.020 --> 19:31.460
[107 Xiaoximen Hospital]

417
19:28.720 --> 19:30.350
so I can take a nap during my lunch break.

418
19:30.350 --> 19:31.550
Oh he's off work now.

419
19:32.790 --> 19:33.960
Why the long face?

420
19:35.240 --> 19:36.270
He looks like someone bullied him.

421
19:36.270 --> 19:37.750
Dr. Zhong was like that when he first got here, too.

422
19:37.750 --> 19:39.160
Right. W-Who isn't like that at first?

423
19:37.860 --> 19:40.420
[107 Xiaoximen Hospital]

424
19:39.160 --> 19:39.690
Exactly.

425
19:40.510 --> 19:41.840
He's got quite a temper.

426
19:47.240 --> 19:48.440
So, how's that going now?

427
19:48.440 --> 19:49.160
It's okay.

428
19:49.160 --> 19:51.310
Who upset him?

429
19:51.480 --> 19:52.720
Why is he unhappy?

430
19:55.070 --> 19:55.640
Chen,

431
19:56.640 --> 19:57.590
how did I never realize

432
19:57.590 --> 19:59.520
you were such a hopeless romantic?

433
20:00.920 --> 20:02.920
You moved

434
20:03.240 --> 20:03.920
our whole business

435
20:03.920 --> 20:06.270
to Xiaoximen Hospital just for that human beanpole.

436
20:06.270 --> 20:07.670
You looking for trouble?

437
20:08.510 --> 20:10.160
You think I'd really do all this

438
20:10.160 --> 20:11.240
for Wonder Doc?

439
20:12.030 --> 20:12.720
Couldn't dodge that one.

440
20:12.720 --> 20:14.120
This is a great location.

441
20:14.640 --> 20:17.200
I should grow the business and make it stronger, right?

442
20:17.200 --> 20:18.640
Why don't you focus

443
20:18.640 --> 20:20.840
on improving the business first, okay?

444
20:21.070 --> 20:22.830
If you're going to get involved, do it properly.

445
20:22.830 --> 20:24.830
Hey, hey, slow down! It's too runny!

446
20:25.440 --> 20:27.900
Honestly, you never know your own strength.

447
20:28.830 --> 20:30.200
Your Wonder Doc

448
20:30.680 --> 20:32.070
even saved that patient

449
20:32.070 --> 20:33.550
whose brain was spilling out

450
20:33.550 --> 20:34.750
at the hospital.

451
20:35.350 --> 20:36.240
I bet

452
20:36.270 --> 20:38.070
as long as he's at Xiaoximen Hospital,

453
20:38.070 --> 20:38.720
our business

454
20:38.720 --> 20:40.650
will keep getting worse and worse.

455
20:41.480 --> 20:42.200
Chen.

456
20:44.720 --> 20:45.440
Chen.

457
20:46.960 --> 20:47.960
You're hopeless.

458
21:04.000 --> 21:05.000
You can drink with everyone else,

459
21:05.000 --> 21:05.860
but not with me?

460
21:05.920 --> 21:06.830
Fill it up. Come on.

461
21:06.830 --> 21:08.480
Zhong, Zhong.

462
21:09.200 --> 21:10.830
How much weight have you gained?

463
21:10.830 --> 21:12.760
Huang, this liquor's pretty good.

464
21:14.270 --> 21:15.510
Huang's treating us!

465
21:15.510 --> 21:16.640
Look at this spread!

466
21:16.920 --> 21:18.920
It's fine to mix these two.

467
21:20.160 --> 21:21.560
We'll mix them together.

468
21:23.590 --> 21:24.350
Hold on,

469
21:24.350 --> 21:26.110
the rest of the dishes aren't out yet.

470
21:26.110 --> 21:27.440
Here come the cold dishes!

471
21:27.440 --> 21:27.960
Have you gained weight?

472
21:27.960 --> 21:28.510
Yeah.

473
21:28.720 --> 21:30.650
I could tell just by looking at you.

474
21:30.790 --> 21:31.440
Huang,

475
21:31.440 --> 21:33.030
look at you, even combing your hair!

476
21:33.030 --> 21:33.590
What's

477
21:33.590 --> 21:34.440
the occasion? Got some good news or what?

478
21:34.440 --> 21:36.040
It's just from wearing a hat.

479
21:36.110 --> 21:37.400
No, wait till tomorrow,

480
21:37.400 --> 21:38.110
when I do my runway walk.

481
21:38.110 --> 21:39.840
I'll tell you all about it then.

482
21:40.480 --> 21:41.830
All right, you guys eat first.

483
21:41.830 --> 21:43.490
I'll bring out the hot dishes.

484
21:44.200 --> 21:45.260
Come on, everyone.

485
21:45.720 --> 21:46.550
W-What?

486
21:47.160 --> 21:48.030
S-Should I start us off with a toast?

487
21:48.030 --> 21:48.590
Go ahead.

488
21:49.160 --> 21:49.830
Come on, come on.

489
21:49.830 --> 21:51.350
I'm the senior one here, right?

490
21:51.350 --> 21:51.680
Exactly.

491
21:51.680 --> 21:53.200
All right, I'll make the toast.

492
21:53.200 --> 21:54.310
Well,

493
21:55.200 --> 21:57.400
there are two things I want to say today.

494
21:57.790 --> 21:59.240
Just Two things,

495
21:59.240 --> 21:59.640
only two.

496
21:59.640 --> 22:00.510
First,

497
22:00.750 --> 22:02.720
we're here to celebrate

498
22:03.310 --> 22:04.960
Dr. Liu's triumphant arrival

499
22:04.960 --> 22:06.750
at Xiaoximen Hospital.

500
22:07.240 --> 22:08.070
A round of applause!

501
22:08.070 --> 22:09.730
A triumphant arrival indeed!

502
22:10.030 --> 22:11.240
And s-second,

503
22:11.590 --> 22:12.350
what's the second thing?

504
22:12.350 --> 22:13.410
We're celebrating

505
22:13.640 --> 22:14.640
our hospital's success

506
22:14.640 --> 22:15.880
in performing Zhang Jiao's surgery.

507
22:15.880 --> 22:16.880
In all these years,

508
22:16.880 --> 22:18.160
we've never had such an...

509
22:18.160 --> 22:20.350
such an outstanding achievement.

510
22:21.480 --> 22:22.480
This is a big deal.

511
22:23.310 --> 22:24.590
From now on,

512
22:24.590 --> 22:25.790
we're all one family,

513
22:25.830 --> 22:27.630
so we should help each other out.

514
22:28.160 --> 22:29.680
So this toast is really

515
22:29.680 --> 22:31.270
for today's guest of honor,

516
22:32.240 --> 22:33.110
Dr. Liu—

517
22:33.200 --> 22:34.800
our very own Liu Zhengliang!

518
22:35.680 --> 22:37.680
May you weather every storm ahead

519
22:37.880 --> 22:40.080
and face life's hardships with a smile.

520
22:42.480 --> 22:43.540
-Cheers. -Come on.

521
22:43.920 --> 22:44.750
-Cheers. -Come on.

522
22:44.750 --> 22:45.240
-Cheers. -Come on.

523
22:45.240 --> 22:46.480
Let's have a few drinks.

524
22:46.480 --> 22:47.310
Pretty good,

525
22:47.310 --> 22:47.920
right?

526
22:47.920 --> 22:48.750
Come on.

527
22:49.920 --> 22:51.180
It tastes really sour.

528
22:51.550 --> 22:53.030
Here come the hot dishes!

529
22:54.750 --> 22:55.410
How's that?

530
22:55.790 --> 22:56.920
Quite a spread, huh?

531
22:58.960 --> 22:59.400
What do you think?

532
22:59.400 --> 23:00.350
Yeah, yeah, looks great!

533
23:00.350 --> 23:01.070
Dr. Liu,

534
23:01.310 --> 23:02.960
I've heard all about what you've done.

535
23:02.960 --> 23:03.880
You're amazing!

536
23:03.880 --> 23:05.720
These two dishes are on the house, just for you.

537
23:05.720 --> 23:06.720
Sweet and sour pork and braised pork bones.

538
23:06.720 --> 23:07.380
How's that?

539
23:07.790 --> 23:09.270
These are way too generous.

540
23:09.270 --> 23:10.240
You bet!

541
23:10.270 --> 23:11.640
N-No, it's not necessary.

542
23:11.640 --> 23:12.240
Thank you.

543
23:12.720 --> 23:13.680
What's this?

544
23:13.790 --> 23:15.720
Getting all formal with me today?

545
23:16.350 --> 23:17.550
It's just that I don't like

546
23:17.550 --> 23:19.150
taking advantage of people.

547
23:19.830 --> 23:21.350
How's that taking advantage of anyone?

548
23:21.350 --> 23:22.030
We all help

549
23:22.030 --> 23:23.720
each other out, right?

550
23:24.160 --> 23:25.310
If I ever get sick,

551
23:25.310 --> 23:26.480
I'll come see you at the hospital.

552
23:26.480 --> 23:27.350
You'd give me

553
23:27.350 --> 23:29.920
a couple extra bottles of glucose, wouldn't you?

554
23:29.920 --> 23:30.440
Um,

555
23:30.440 --> 23:32.000
hospital rules won't let me

556
23:32.000 --> 23:33.070
give you glucose for free.

557
23:33.070 --> 23:33.680
And I won't eat a single bite

558
23:33.680 --> 23:35.070
of these two dishes.

559
23:36.030 --> 23:37.510
The boss lady's just joking with you.

560
23:37.510 --> 23:38.880
You think she'd really

561
23:38.880 --> 23:39.750
ask you for glucose?

562
23:39.750 --> 23:40.440
If she ever does—

563
23:40.440 --> 23:41.640
look, if she asks you for any,

564
23:41.640 --> 23:42.110
j-just tell me.

565
23:42.110 --> 23:43.240
I'll get it for her.

566
23:43.350 --> 23:44.920
I-It's only a couple of bottles, right?

567
23:44.920 --> 23:45.680
Huang,

568
23:45.680 --> 23:46.920
if you're getting them for me,

569
23:46.920 --> 23:49.120
I'll have to ask for a few extra bottles!

570
23:49.440 --> 23:50.370
Come on, you two!

571
23:50.680 --> 23:51.550
With you two being so close,

572
23:51.550 --> 23:53.010
you don't even need to ask!

573
23:53.240 --> 23:54.510
All right, enjoy.

574
23:54.790 --> 23:55.720
Come on, come on.

575
23:56.160 --> 23:57.590
Dig in! Try the sweet and sour pork.

576
23:57.590 --> 23:58.110
Come on.

577
23:58.110 --> 23:59.790
This sweet and sour pork is excellent!

578
23:59.790 --> 24:00.680
Come on, let's have a toast.

579
24:00.680 --> 24:01.110
Come on.

580
24:01.110 --> 24:02.510
You should try their sweet and sour pork.

581
24:02.510 --> 24:03.110
It's really good.

582
24:03.110 --> 24:04.790
Come on, who... who wants to make a toast?

583
24:04.790 --> 24:06.000
Have some meat.

584
24:07.640 --> 24:09.110
Zhengliang, Zhengliang.

585
24:10.000 --> 24:10.860
It's your turn.

586
24:10.880 --> 24:11.640
You're the guest of honor today.

587
24:11.640 --> 24:13.040
How about making a toast?

588
24:14.880 --> 24:16.030
I don't drink.

589
24:16.750 --> 24:17.880
Well, how about

590
24:17.880 --> 24:18.640
just a little?

591
24:18.640 --> 24:19.160
Pour him some, pour him some.

592
24:19.160 --> 24:20.000
Just a little.

593
24:20.000 --> 24:20.270
Right, right.

594
24:20.270 --> 24:21.200
Pour him some.

595
24:21.200 --> 24:22.600
I can't drink even a drop.

596
24:26.510 --> 24:28.160
Well, if you don't want to drink, that's fine.

597
24:28.160 --> 24:29.640
Let's have some juice instead.

598
24:29.640 --> 24:30.590
Pour him some juice.

599
24:30.590 --> 24:31.350
All right.

600
24:31.510 --> 24:32.790
That works too.

601
24:33.160 --> 24:35.090
G-Grab some juice and make a toast.

602
24:35.480 --> 24:36.960
Do me a favor and make a toast.

603
24:36.960 --> 24:37.960
Who are you?

604
24:38.400 --> 24:39.860
Why should I do you a favor?

605
24:59.880 --> 25:01.000
All right, then.

606
25:01.000 --> 25:01.860
How about this?

607
25:02.310 --> 25:03.440
Just take a tiny sip.

608
25:03.680 --> 25:05.110
Or grab some juice

609
25:05.270 --> 25:06.750
and make a toast. Either works.

610
25:06.750 --> 25:07.550
You choose.

611
25:08.680 --> 25:09.680
Anything's fine.

612
25:15.510 --> 25:16.640
I can't make a toast.

613
25:16.640 --> 25:18.240
You guys enjoy. I'm leaving.

614
25:18.790 --> 25:19.200
Liu.

615
25:19.200 --> 25:19.790
Don't...

616
25:20.680 --> 25:21.480
Liu!

617
25:24.000 --> 25:24.880
Did he just leave?

618
25:24.880 --> 25:26.000
What's gotten into him?

619
25:26.000 --> 25:26.880
Who said what?

620
25:26.880 --> 25:27.720
I don't know.

621
25:27.720 --> 25:29.250
What's with that attitude?

622
25:29.830 --> 25:30.890
Maybe he's just...

623
25:31.920 --> 25:32.920
shy around people.

624
25:32.920 --> 25:34.380
Well, I-I'll make a toast.

625
25:34.480 --> 25:35.510
Let me make a toast.

626
25:35.510 --> 25:37.350
-Come on, come on. -Let's all raise our glasses.

627
25:37.350 --> 25:38.410
-Come on. -Come on.

628
25:39.070 --> 25:40.160
-Come on. -Come on.

629
25:56.800 --> 26:04.860
[Emergency Department–Yellow Zone]

630
26:05.030 --> 26:05.830
Sir,

631
26:05.920 --> 26:07.070
you can't sleep here.

632
26:07.070 --> 26:08.680
Sir?

633
26:08.880 --> 26:10.070
Sir, wake up!

634
26:15.720 --> 26:16.680
Dr. Yang,

635
26:17.240 --> 26:18.960
there's an unconscious patient here.

636
26:18.960 --> 26:20.400
Come take a look, quick!

637
26:21.790 --> 26:22.960
I-I remember him.

638
26:23.160 --> 26:25.590
He has a pituitary tumor, but there is no family consent for surgery.

639
26:25.590 --> 26:27.200
W-why is he still here?

640
26:27.200 --> 26:28.640
Get him to the resuscitation room, now!

641
26:28.640 --> 26:30.610
[Prosperous Dynasty]

642
26:30.610 --> 26:34.990
[Xiaoximen Hospital]

643
26:43.680 --> 26:44.810
What a coincidence!

644
26:47.510 --> 26:48.710
What brings you here?

645
26:49.550 --> 26:50.270
Looks like we'll be seeing a lot

646
26:50.270 --> 26:51.720
of each other from now on.

647
26:52.200 --> 26:55.000
I just taken over a shop across the street from you.

648
26:57.110 --> 27:01.240
[Xiaoximen Hospital]

649
26:58.270 --> 26:59.330
Haven't eaten yet?

650
27:01.030 --> 27:01.960
I'll eat at home.

651
27:02.160 --> 27:02.830
Perfect!

652
27:02.920 --> 27:04.070
Let me treat you to some barbecue, then.

653
27:04.070 --> 27:04.880
No thanks.

654
27:04.960 --> 27:06.070
I bought instant noodles.

655
27:06.070 --> 27:07.160
I'll just cook them myself.

656
27:07.160 --> 27:08.440
Come on, you're a grown man. Why are you being so fussy?

657
27:08.440 --> 27:11.170
What's the big deal about having a meal together?

658
27:12.510 --> 27:14.880
Let's clear the air about what happened before,

659
27:14.880 --> 27:16.680
so I can stop wondering about it.

660
27:21.960 --> 27:22.960
I'll drink it all.

661
27:23.590 --> 27:24.000
Nice!

662
27:24.000 --> 27:24.790
That burns.

663
27:25.440 --> 27:26.590
Liu Zhengliang

664
27:28.240 --> 27:29.110
is so arrogant.

665
27:29.510 --> 27:32.240
He looks down on people from small towns like ours.

666
27:32.240 --> 27:33.880
No, no, that's not it.

667
27:33.880 --> 27:34.590
To give credit where it's due,

668
27:34.590 --> 27:35.400
he's really good at what he does

669
27:35.400 --> 27:35.920
and has a strong personality.

670
27:35.920 --> 27:36.920
Xiaoximen Hospital

671
27:36.920 --> 27:38.440
really needs talents like him.

672
27:38.440 --> 27:39.510
Right, right!

673
27:39.640 --> 27:41.480
All he wants is to get out of here.

674
27:41.480 --> 27:42.030
H-He

675
27:42.110 --> 27:43.880
