N-No. I'm not calling.

1007
38:49.000 --> 38:49.960
Come on, come on.

1008
38:50.030 --> 38:52.430
It'll help you practice talking to people.

1009
38:54.550 --> 38:55.610
The ringback tone.

1010
38:55.920 --> 38:56.760
Didn't I tell you?

1011
38:56.760 --> 38:58.030
I'm not going. I'm not going.

1012
38:58.030 --> 38:59.230
Don't call me again.

1013
38:59.710 --> 39:01.280
Wait, it's Liu Zhengliang. Hone—

1014
39:01.280 --> 39:02.030
Tell her where you're calling from.

1015
39:02.030 --> 39:03.760
I'm a doctor in the emergency department

1016
39:03.760 --> 39:05.150
at Xiaoximen Hospital.

1017
39:05.360 --> 39:06.630
Do you know Kang Sheng?

1018
39:06.630 --> 39:08.150
What? Is Kang Sheng dead?

1019
39:08.510 --> 39:09.840
No, no, he's not dead.

1020
39:09.960 --> 39:11.760
He needs emergency surgery right away.

1021
39:11.760 --> 39:12.960
He's in the hospital?

1022
39:13.110 --> 39:13.970
I'm not coming.

1023
39:14.670 --> 39:15.440
It's urgent?

1024
39:15.440 --> 39:16.590
Then I'm definitely not coming.

1025
39:16.590 --> 39:17.230
What does it have to do with me?

1026
39:17.230 --> 39:18.000
It does concern you,

1027
39:18.000 --> 39:19.880
because we need someone

1028
39:20.190 --> 39:21.000
to come and—

1029
39:21.110 --> 39:21.800
Call disconnected.

1030
39:21.800 --> 39:23.710
Scroll up. See if there's anyone further down.

1031
39:23.710 --> 39:24.440
Scroll up

1032
39:24.440 --> 39:25.590
and see if there's anyone else.

1033
39:25.590 --> 39:26.280
Here.

1034
39:26.590 --> 39:28.280
Kang Yun. Same last name.

1035
39:28.280 --> 39:28.800
-Yes. -And.

1036
39:28.800 --> 39:29.510
it could be his son.

1037
39:29.510 --> 39:30.480
They talk a lot.

1038
39:32.840 --> 39:33.630
Hello.

1039
39:33.670 --> 39:35.110
I'm Liu Zhengliang,

1040
39:35.400 --> 39:36.150
a doctor in the emergency department

1041
39:36.150 --> 39:37.670
at Xiaoximen Hospital.

1042
39:37.880 --> 39:39.140
Do you know Kang Sheng?

1043
39:40.190 --> 39:41.150
I'm his brother.

1044
39:42.440 --> 39:43.510
Hello, hello!

1045
39:43.510 --> 39:44.280
Thank goodness.

1046
39:44.280 --> 39:44.800
Here's the situation: Mr. Kang

1047
39:44.800 --> 39:45.710
needs emergency surgery

1048
39:45.710 --> 39:46.360
right away.

1049
39:46.360 --> 39:47.030
So we need someone

1050
39:47.030 --> 39:47.630
to come over and sign the consent form for him.

1051
39:47.630 --> 39:49.320
How much are you paying me?

1052
39:49.550 --> 39:50.480
This isn't about money.

1053
39:50.480 --> 39:51.610
It's about his life!

1054
39:51.670 --> 39:52.280
-It's about saving his life! -If

1055
39:52.280 --> 39:53.360
you don't sign the consent,

1056
39:53.360 --> 39:53.800
his life

1057
39:53.800 --> 39:54.630
could be in danger.

1058
39:54.630 --> 39:56.800
If there's no money in it for me,

1059
39:57.000 --> 40:00.000
why are you calling? You're making me lose money here!

1060
40:00.110 --> 40:01.070
Is that really his own brother?

1061
40:01.070 --> 40:02.930
Try another one. Try another one.

1062
40:03.880 --> 40:05.190
Y-You talk to her. Go on,

1063
40:05.190 --> 40:06.510
You can explain it better.

1064
40:06.510 --> 40:08.840
Hello, Hone— Um...

1065
40:09.150 --> 40:09.920
Xiaoximen!

1066
40:09.920 --> 40:10.230
Right.

1067
40:10.230 --> 40:11.760
I-I'm from Xiaoximen Hospital.

1068
40:11.760 --> 40:13.150
My name is Liu Zhengliang.

1069
40:13.150 --> 40:14.360
Kang Sheng

1070
40:14.360 --> 40:15.190
has lost consciousness

1071
40:15.190 --> 40:16.000
and needs emergency treatment.

1072
40:16.000 --> 40:17.510
Someone has to sign the consent form.

1073
40:17.510 --> 40:18.320
Could you come over

1074
40:18.320 --> 40:19.440
and sign it for him?

1075
40:19.440 --> 40:20.070
Oh, for heaven's sake!

1076
40:20.070 --> 40:21.190
What does he have to do with me?

1077
40:21.190 --> 40:22.030
Let him go to whoever he wants!

1078
40:22.030 --> 40:22.710
I'm telling you,

1079
40:22.710 --> 40:24.030
we're long over.

1080
40:24.030 --> 40:25.190
He always wants what he has

1081
40:25.190 --> 40:25.880
and what he doesn't have.

1082
40:25.880 --> 40:27.030
What a piece of work!

1083
40:27.400 --> 40:28.590
Dating him

1084
40:28.590 --> 40:29.280
was the worst luck

1085
40:29.280 --> 40:30.360
I've ever had.

1086
40:30.360 --> 40:31.030
What a jerk!

1087
40:31.030 --> 40:31.360
I'm hanging up.

1088
40:31.360 --> 40:32.590
Don't call me again!

1089
40:33.230 --> 40:34.030
Come on.

1090
40:34.590 --> 40:36.670
♪ Love isn't something you can sell ♪

1091
40:36.880 --> 40:38.150
♪ Just because you want to ♪

1092
40:38.150 --> 40:39.150
Keep going, keep going.

1093
40:39.150 --> 40:40.190
Honey 8.

1094
40:40.440 --> 40:41.500
I loved him so much,

1095
40:42.320 --> 40:44.320
and he went and found another woman.

1096
40:44.630 --> 40:46.960
She's over twenty years younger than him.

1097
40:47.230 --> 40:48.490
What a shameless jerk!

1098
40:52.360 --> 40:53.550
Number nine? Call number nine?

1099
40:53.550 --> 40:56.030
At first, we were neighbors by day

1100
40:56.360 --> 40:57.590
and lovers by night.

1101
40:57.840 --> 40:59.710
Then we became lovers by day

1102
40:59.760 --> 41:01.150
and neighbors by night.

1103
41:01.670 --> 41:02.590
And by "lovers,"

1104
41:02.590 --> 41:04.650
I don't mean we were legally married.

1105
41:05.880 --> 41:07.800
Don't call me about signing anything.

1106
41:07.800 --> 41:09.030
I'm in Iceland.

1107
41:09.840 --> 41:11.000
Thank heavens!

1108
41:11.030 --> 41:13.000
He finally opened his eyes.

1109
41:13.400 --> 41:14.330
I'm telling you,

1110
41:14.510 --> 41:15.960
a man like him

1111
41:16.150 --> 41:18.110
should've been— should've been dead long ago.

1112
41:18.110 --> 41:19.480
Call another one, call another one!

1113
41:19.480 --> 41:20.230
Hello,

1114
41:20.230 --> 41:21.070
this is Xiaoximen Hospital.

1115
41:21.070 --> 41:22.280
Kang Sheng is in the emergency room right now.

1116
41:22.280 --> 41:23.320
I don't know him.

1117
41:26.280 --> 41:28.000
He's got thirteen "Honey,"

1118
41:29.190 --> 41:30.590
each with a number.

1119
41:30.590 --> 41:32.030
I've seen it all now.

1120
41:32.230 --> 41:33.190
Today, I've finally learned

1121
41:33.190 --> 41:34.800
what it means to be abandoned by everyone

1122
41:34.800 --> 41:36.060
and reap what one sows.

1123
41:36.280 --> 41:37.400
But honestly,

1124
41:38.760 --> 41:39.840
I'm jealous.

1125
41:40.480 --> 41:42.110
So jealous.

1126
41:56.190 --> 41:57.230
Where is he?

1127
41:57.920 --> 41:59.250
Who are you looking for?

1128
41:59.590 --> 42:00.630
Didn't you ask the police

1129
42:00.630 --> 42:01.670
to find me?

1130
42:02.710 --> 42:04.240
I'm Kang Sheng's daughter.

1131
42:04.590 --> 42:06.390
He's in the resuscitation room.

1132
42:06.520 --> 42:09.940
[No Entry]

1133
42:09.800 --> 42:10.800
You may head back.

1134
42:12.190 --> 42:13.790
Call me if anything comes up.

1135
42:13.800 --> 42:14.590
Thanks.

1136
42:19.880 --> 42:20.670
Hello.

1137
42:20.880 --> 42:22.610
Hello. We need you to sign here.

1138
42:22.880 --> 42:24.010
Good thing you came.

1139
42:24.070 --> 42:26.360
Otherwise, your dad might not have made it.

1140
42:26.360 --> 42:27.150
Are you done?

1141
42:29.630 --> 42:31.160
I agree to forgo treatment.

1142
42:31.630 --> 42:32.690
No more treatment.

1143
42:35.150 --> 42:35.960
Wait,

1144
42:36.150 --> 42:36.840
maybe I didn't make myself

1145
42:36.840 --> 42:37.920
clear just now.

1146
42:38.110 --> 42:39.030
Mr. Kang needs emergency

1147
42:39.030 --> 42:40.150
brain surgery right away,

1148
42:40.150 --> 42:41.750
or his life will be in danger.

1149
42:42.070 --> 42:43.840
This is the informed consent form.

1150
42:43.840 --> 42:45.280
You just need to sign here.

1151
42:45.280 --> 42:47.540
You don't have to pay anything right now.

1152
43:05.340 --> 43:08.650
[I refuse surgery and further treatment.]
